WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.800
Narrator: Now CPR and the AED, on a manikin.

2
00:00:05.300 --> 00:00:08.500
Narrator: Notice what the marshal does while the trained person works: makes the call, fetches the AED, keeps people back, and meets the medics.

3
00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:14.800
Narrator: That's your part.

